      "description": "<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>This module count as <strong>two enable modules</strong></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>This <strong>personal vehicle</strong> can fly, and its <strong>distance</strong> becomes ×3.</p>\n    <p>While you are driving this <strong>personal vehicle</strong>, your melee attacks can target <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Flying</span></strong></a></span></span> creatures, and none of the creatures inside the <strong>personal vehicle</strong> can be targeted by melee attacks unless the attacker is <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Flying</span></strong></a></span></span> or is somehow able to reach <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Flying</span></strong></a></span></span> targets.</p>\n    <p>These benefits do not apply while the <strong>personal vehicle</strong> is inacti